    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d174">

                <pb facs="0266" n="160" xml:id="pg160"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Egan to Mr.
                            Wharton</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Santiago</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1891-09-07"><hi rendition="#italic">September 7,
                        1891</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Mr. Egan states that he is in cordial communication with the Provisional
                    Government, established on the 4th instant, with Jorge Montt as President, and
                    that the Government is universally accepted by the people.</p>
            </div>
